    We basically need to find the maximum height of the bar from the left end upto an index i in the array left_max.

    Similarly find the maximum height of the bar from the right end upto an index i in the array right_max.

    Iterate over the height array and update ans



    Time Complexity: O(n^2) , where n is the number of bars in the histogram.

